3. JSP REQUEST FLOW

ALGORITHM JSPRequestFlow

BEGIN
    CLIENT sends HTTP request for JSP page

    RECEIVE request at Web Server

    FORWARD request to JSP Container

    CHECK whether JSP page is already compiled

    IF JSP page is not compiled THEN
        TRANSLATE JSP page into Servlet
        COMPILE generated Servlet
    END IF

    EXECUTE JSP Servlet

    JSP Servlet processes request

    IF backend processing is required THEN
        CALL Servlet or JavaBean

        IF database operation is required THEN
            ESTABLISH database connection
            EXECUTE SQL query
            RETRIEVE required data
            PROCESS result
            CLOSE database connection
        END IF

        RETURN processed data to JSP
    END IF

    JSP combines HTML with dynamic data

    GENERATE dynamic HTML response

    SEND response to Web Server

    Web Server sends HTTP response to CLIENT

    CLIENT displays generated web page

END
